    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "props": {
        "html": "Hello [[FIRSTNAME OR \"Friend\"]],<br><br>Thank you for spending a day at the Theodore Roosevelt Presidential Library. If you carried a Trailblazer through the galleries, your journal and photos arrived in a separate email. They stay online for 30 days, so save the ones you want to keep.",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "props": {
        "html": "<b>Thank you for visiting as a member.</b> Your membership covers every visit until it renews, so come back whenever the Badlands call.",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "cond": {
        "group": "p1",
        "tag": "custom.acme_-_is_active_member",
        "field": "Acme - Is Active Member",
        "label": "Membership",
        "other": "Not a member",
        "kind": "if",
        "is": [
          "active",
          "new"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "divider",
      "props": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "text": "Tell Us What to Send You",
        "align": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "props": {
        "html": "The Library's newsletter, <i>Mail from the Badlands</i>, comes in topics. Pick the ones you care about, and those are the only ones you will get.",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "props": {
        "intro": "",
        "note": "",
        "columns": [
          "Topic",
          "What arrives"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "From the Archive",
            "One story a month from the collection: a page of T.R.'s diary, a letter home from the Badlands, an object with a history."
          ],
          [
            "The Badlands",
            "A monthly look at the landscape that shaped T.R., and at the native prairie being restored across the Library's 93 acres."
          ],
          [
            "Events & Programs",
            "Talks, family days, festivals and evening programs, sent while seats are still open."
          ],
          [
            "Library News & History",
            "Exhibition openings, building news and stories from the collection. The one to pick if you pick only one."
          ],
          [
            "Conservation & Sustainability",
            "How the building works and what the land is doing, plus the Native Plant Project."
          ],
          [
            "Salt+Scoria",
            "Seasonal menus, special dinners and reservation windows at the Library's restaurant."
          ],
          [
            "The Shop",
            "New arrivals, seasonal sales and small-batch goods from the Library Shop."
          ],
          [
            "Educators & Homeschool",
            "Primary sources, field trip booking windows and professional development, five or six emails a year."
          ]
        ],
